#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:5
#: 557a1b3235e4445295ef6ef7c26270d1
msgid "Using the Command Line Interface"
msgstr "使用命令行界面"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:9
#: ba067ceddbbf4956b496aa34120bb9a4
msgid ""
"The CLI is being phased out on all platforms. The features were massively "
"cut down with AC3.1.5 and then it was removed for the APM2 completely anyway"
" with AC3.2. All CLI functions are now available via regular MAVLink "
"commands in the GCSs. This article has been moved to the dev wiki and may be"
" considered deprecated."
msgstr ""
"CLI 正在所有平台上逐步淘汰。其功能在 AC3.1.5 中被大幅削减，在 AC3.2 中又彻底从 APM2 上移除。所有 CLI "
"功能现在可通过地面站中的常规 MAVLink 命令使用。本文已移至开发 wiki，可视为已废弃。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:15
#: 828a0640087441a5b1bd5caae66c87c4
msgid "MOVE ALL THE CLI INFO TO THIS PAGE"
msgstr "将所有 CLI 信息移至本页"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:17
#: 19d3af67f366475cb668bd27521d44c4
msgid "ALSO Mission Planer Terminal"
msgstr "还有 Mission Planner 终端"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:20
#: f7f8d1f53a064a4da71258b32642a655
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:22
#: 162f3015e4a24f4db4c986d43786f905
msgid ""
"The Command Line Interface (CLI) is an alternative to the Configurator. It "
"does most of what the Configurator does, but in a text interface. One reason"
" to use this is that you may not be able to run the Configurator (if you're "
"running Linux, for example, or a Mac without a Windows emulator). You may "
"also prefer it because it's fast and clean. (There are also a few commands "
"that are only available in the CLI)."
msgstr ""
"命令行界面（CLI）是配置器的替代方案。它能完成配置器的大部分功能，但使用文本界面。使用它的原因之一是您可能无法运行配置器（例如在 Linux 或没有 "
"Windows 模拟器的 Mac 上）。您也可能更喜欢它，因为它快速简洁。（还有一些只在 CLI 中可用的命令。）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:29
#: e939ae2a8e3f4a2fa6f51754d6755b24
msgid ""
"The way the CLI is used is by sliding the slider switch on the IMU board "
"towards the servo connectors."
msgstr "使用 CLI 的方式是将 IMU 板上的拨动开关拨向舵机接口方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:32
#: 5ae796e5feb1489d92529a36f76092dc
msgid "**Don't forget to return it to the other position before you fly!**"
msgstr "**飞行前请务必将其拨回原位！**"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:34
#: 9b04aa339f49493489b292596448d32f
msgid ""
"Now open the Arduino serial monitor, setting baud rate to 115200 baud and "
"ensuring that \"Carriage Returns\" are enabled. You should see a command "
"line on the monitor:"
msgstr "现在打开 Arduino 串口监视器，将波特率设置为 115200，并确保启用了「回车」。您应该在监视器上看到命令行："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:42
#: 0d7f528ea82940ccae9d50ffa6ee550a
msgid "Available commands"
msgstr "可用命令"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:44
#: 062862cf6ddd4f1cba812f712c3852c9
msgid "Commands that are supported from current CLI are:"
msgstr "当前 CLI 支持的命令有："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:46
#: 92e5c7ca638d473da7942aba01b6f862
msgid "**a - Activate/Deactivate compass**"
msgstr "**a - 激活/停用罗盘**"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:48
#: ffa48a066d5a41b5884667f3ef66fb88
msgid ""
"Every second 'a' activates / deactivates your compass usage inside program. "
"You also need to check that #define IsMAG is selected inside program"
msgstr "每按一次「a」可在程序中激活/停用罗盘使用。您还需要确认程序中选择了 #define IsMAG"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:52
#: f92341fc33304816bf16b41f61c5d1fc
msgid "**c - Compass offset calibration**"
msgstr "**c - 罗盘偏移校准**"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:54
#: e195875d6d1c4ddba6972d2b05130066
msgid ""
"Roll/Pitch/Move/Rock/Twist your quad on every direction, even upside down "
"until offset numbers are not changing. After values are as desired hit "
"'Enter' to save values and to exit back to main menu"
msgstr "向各个方向滚转/俯仰/移动/摇晃/旋转您的四旋翼，甚至倒置，直到偏移数值不再变化。当数值达到预期后，按「Enter」保存数值并退回主菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:58
#: edbcf1e9bb78462caf751b854dcd870a
msgid "**e - ESC Max Throttle calibration**"
msgstr "**e - ESC 最大油门校准**"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:60
#: 494a86ec99224c89b1357faa150ebb7f
msgid ""
"Official Copter ESCs (and few others too, you can test) supports automatic "
"max/min throttle calibrations."
msgstr "官方 Copter ESC（以及少数其他 ESC，您可以测试）支持自动最大/最小油门校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:63
#: d0d5a8ae27434755814be2c49b3ae046
msgid "SAFETY! Disconnect your propellers first!"
msgstr "安全！请先拆下螺旋桨！"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:64
#: c7861eabbfd0453497122ec782f7061e
msgid "Activate this calibration"
msgstr "激活此校准"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:65
#: 3f4bc5d1a13846f28f6464b6f6903d8e
msgid "Disconnect your battery but keep USB cable connected"
msgstr "断开电池连接，但保持 USB 线连接"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:66
#: dd35bab150e4466eb3b3bf6cf89a59cb
msgid "Move your throttle stick to \"full\""
msgstr "将油门摇杆推至「最大」"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:67
#: 2f2ef957e4f5418da9bf3927702edb00
msgid "Connect your battery and listen normal ESC beepboop.. reboot sounds"
msgstr "连接电池，听到正常的 ESC 开机哔哔声"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:69
#: 799caf0a35374a0eb9a67a359b4797be
msgid "After ESCs send Beep Beep sound, move your throttle to minimum"
msgstr "当 ESC 发出「哔哔」声后，将油门摇杆移至最小"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:70
#: 3364210cdd92451caa1e589dabf81fa4
msgid "Listen final beep sound from ESCs"
msgstr "等待 ESC 发出最后的确认哔声"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:72
#: ae51e7c6c5fc44a8ac3f9722b54e537d
msgid ""
"Give small throttle to your APM:Copter to see that all motors spins same "
"speed"
msgstr "给 APM:Copter 少量油门，查看所有电机是否以相同速度旋转"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:75
#: 22811cf8d66e4109b8a5c1363bca0a3b
msgid "If they do not spin, redo calibration"
msgstr "如果不旋转，请重新校准"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:77
#: 4be894020dfd48b99fea26f61893670f
msgid "Hit 'Enter' to disarm all motors and to exit from ESC Calibration"
msgstr "按「Enter」解除所有电机武装并退出 ESC 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:79
#: 09773b604cd041efb730239870bff3d1
msgid ""
"If you are not using the official APM:Copter ESCs, you can manually "
"calibrate them one by one by connecting each ESC to your RC receiver's "
"channel 3 output. Unplug your battery, move transmitter throttle stick to "
"full, and reconnect the battery. Wait for the beeps to stop, then bring the "
"throttle stick down to the minimum again. Repeat for all four ESCs."
msgstr ""
"如果您不使用官方 APM:Copter ESC，可以通过将每个 ESC 连接到遥控接收机的通道 3 "
"输出来逐个手动校准。拔出电池，将遥控器油门摇杆推至最大，然后重新连接电池。等待哔声停止，然后将油门摇杆降至最小。对所有四个 ESC 重复此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:86
#: 5e26de81802f412c8ecbfa8c52a241e1
msgid "**i - Initialize and calibrate Accel offsets**"
msgstr "**i - 初始化和校准加速度计偏移**"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:88
#: 43579bb8fb2f46748a0ae875be5effc8
msgid ""
"Place your APM:Copter on level surface and reset its 0-Level with this "
"command. It takes some seconds until samples will be collected. During "
"calibration do not touch/move or in any other ways make your APM:Copter to "
"move."
msgstr ""
"将您的 APM:Copter 放置在水平面上，然后使用此命令重置其 0 水平。需要几秒钟来采集样本。校准期间请勿触碰/移动或以任何方式使您的 "
"APM:Copter 移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:93
#: 6c57c9a53ef341718dcd77a56dc8d94b
msgid "**m - Motor tester with AIL/ELE stick**"
msgstr "**m - 使用 AIL/ELE 摇杆进行电机测试**"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:95
#: 4b75b9e5e8fd433089c9739468d98ac1
msgid ""
"Users can easily test that their ESC/Motors are connected correctly. Move "
"your AIL/ELE stick to up/down/left/right and corresponding motor should "
"start pulsing slowly. Correct motor rotation directions are shown :ref:`here"
" <copter:connect-escs-and-motors>`."
msgstr ""
"用户可以轻松测试其 ESC/电机连接是否正确。将 AIL/ELE 摇杆向上/下/左/右移动，对应的电机应开始缓慢脉动。正确的电机旋转方向如 "
":ref:`此处 <copter:connect-escs-and-motors>` 所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:100
#: f6319ee82a3241ac938865cf985783a4
msgid "SAFETY! Disconnect propellers before doing your test."
msgstr "安全！测试前请拆下螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:102
#: f935f918ab1244abb8fed98d33f5d2b4
msgid ""
"If your motors does not follow your stick input eg. stick to full right and "
"left motors starts, change ESC cable on your Power Distributor PCB or in APM"
" connectors depending where you have connected your ESCs."
msgstr ""
"如果电机没有按摇杆输入响应，例如摇杆推向右侧时左侧电机启动，请根据 ESC 的连接位置，更换电源分发板 PCB 或 APM 接口上的 ESC 线缆。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:106
#: db3bd2ef61d24620bca9ef84f47481c5
msgid "**r - Reset Factory settings**"
msgstr "**r - 恢复出厂设置**"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:108
#: ab99683405844d3a868ea4f6c87ce6c1
msgid "With every new revision you need to reset our EEPROM (just in case)."
msgstr "每次有新版本时，您需要重置 EEPROM（以防万一）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:110
#: 0ebac34a91de4ddfbb9a7b5086ea9a76
msgid "**t - Calibrate MIN Throttle value**"
msgstr "**t - 校准最小油门值**"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:112
#: 72616481f016415a93df8ca9859c89f3
msgid ""
"Read minimum throttle value from your radio. Place throttle at minimum and "
"activate this test, Min throttle value is needed for all altitude hold "
"features and general motor operations."
msgstr "从遥控器读取最小油门值。将油门置于最小位置并激活此测试。所有定高功能和电机操作都需要最小油门值。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:116
#: 56452ec943e74581b984ac4ba934a3de
msgid "**s - Show settings**"
msgstr "**s - 显示设置**"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:118
#: 7a3149ff455142cc8728af82b9e3315f
msgid "Printout most important settings to your serial port."
msgstr "将最重要的设置打印到串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:120
#: c2f64518704b4f1791d2ad9208c9d6d9
msgid ""
"To use the CLI normally to prepare your quad for flight, you need to go "
"through a small number of steps."
msgstr "要正常使用 CLI 为四旋翼准备飞行，您需要完成少量步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:123
#: 88012794b80549ca9d9da46e81d3be70
msgid "Upload the code with the mission planner or Arduino."
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 或 Arduino 上传代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:124
#: d6c9677b0fc74273bb23101e10b6bb80
msgid ""
"In the terminal screen, hit \"Enter\" three times at startup if you're not "
"automatically given the CLI entry prompt."
msgstr "在终端界面，如果启动时未自动出现 CLI 入口提示，请在启动时按三次「Enter」。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:127
#: 64f74a54b3c149fda3a6795411e393b9
msgid ""
"There are three menus in the CLI and you can type \"help\" at any time to "
"see the available menus or commands. Typing \"setup\" will get you into the "
"setup menu."
msgstr "CLI 中有三个菜单，您可以随时输入「help」查看可用菜单或命令。输入「setup」进入设置菜单。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:132
#: 6c350c55f7604877b66d15c9b026e980
msgid "SETUP MENU COMMANDS"
msgstr "设置菜单命令"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:134
#: c9da59a3e0244bbca45d61bea5714a26
msgid ""
"Type \"reset\" to erase the EEPROM and start from scratch. This is an "
"important step to prevent bad/old values from being loaded into a updated "
"firmware installation. Note, after you do this, you will have to run through"
" the"
msgstr ""
"输入「reset」清除 EEPROM 并从头开始。这是防止旧/错误值被加载到更新的固件安装中的重要步骤。注意，执行此操作后，您将需要重新运行"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:139
#: 8d37feea454e4a259a4434ad4a7a1735
msgid ":ref:`ESC calibration process <copter:esc-calibration>` again."
msgstr ":ref:`ESC 校准流程 <copter:esc-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:140
#: d2425707ea884cabbac721447d88ccbf
msgid ""
"After rebooting the APM, connect your radio and enter \"radio\". You will be"
" prompted to move your controls to their extremes and press the enter key to"
" save the values. You should center your trims before running this command!"
msgstr "重启 APM 后，连接遥控器并输入「radio」。系统将提示您将控制器移至极限位置并按回车键保存数值。运行此命令前，请先将微调归中！"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:144
#: 797ab643aafe4b4da7b2deab156efff8
msgid ""
"Run the \"level\" command with your copter on a perfectly level surface. "
"Failing to do this step could lead to a very unstable copter."
msgstr "在完全水平的表面上运行「level」命令。不执行此步骤可能导致多旋翼极不稳定。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:147
#: c5dbf6171e9a40c7b6d091f28e37a208
msgid ""
"Run \"frame\" to see what orientation you have setup for your copter. \"x\" "
"is the default. \"frame +\" for example will enable a plus frame"
msgstr "运行「frame」查看为多旋翼设置的方向。「x」是默认值。例如「frame +」将启用十字型机架"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:149
#: 54539651f2d442f98fd832c8c25d7db5
msgid ""
"Run \"modes\" to setup your flight modes. The roll stick selects modes, the "
"yaw stick selects Simple mode on or off. Move your three position switch and"
" set each mode. Press the enter key to save."
msgstr ""
"运行「modes」设置分配给每个开关位置的飞行模式。横滚摇杆用于选择模式，偏航摇杆用于开启/关闭 Simple "
"模式。移动三档开关并设置每个模式。按回车键保存。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:152
#: 315d70535615450881eda9bd49752847
msgid "Enter \"sonar on\" to enable sonar"
msgstr "输入「sonar on」启用声纳"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:153
#: 14a1ac8ffced498f925e31c6031d957c
msgid "Enter \"compass on\" to enable compass"
msgstr "输入「compass on」启用罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:154
#: 04f1834e9b3c4ca4ab604eac05e11977
msgid ""
"Enter \"declination 14.25\" to save the declination for the compass in "
"decimal degrees."
msgstr "输入「declination 14.25」以十进制度保存罗盘偏磁角。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:156
#: d3ce0b27e1184abf8dcc849229f5af37
msgid "Enter \"exit\" to leave setup."
msgstr "输入「exit」退出设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:159
#: 504705ee8d374587908c4e81b1b579a0
msgid "TEST MENU COMMANDS"
msgstr "测试菜单命令"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:161
#: 1a7b4d99a4d2453daea36bb621f8f58e
msgid "Type \"test\" to enter the test menu from the top menu"
msgstr "从顶层菜单输入「test」进入测试菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:162
#: 6a062a3d14104ad9a2f31ae632d3f08f
msgid ""
"Type \"radio\" to see the output of the radio values. Move the roll/pitch "
"stick to the lower right and look for the value 4500, 4500 (or near that "
"value.) Throttle should be 0 - 800. Yaw is -4500(left) and 4500 (right)."
msgstr ""
"输入「radio」查看遥控器数值输出。将横滚/俯仰摇杆移至右下方，查看数值是否为 4500, 4500（或接近该值）。油门应为 0 - 800。偏航为 "
"-4500（左）和 4500（右）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:167
#: b65c29752495429681b568d387171604
msgid "That's it. You should be ready to fly."
msgstr "就这些。您应该可以准备飞行了。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:169
#: 11a891ebadcb462d85407005144c9924
msgid "AC2CLI"
msgstr "AC2CLI"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:172
#: 46080b1e9c144cd987cad9e54221ab9d
msgid "Using the Command Line Interpreter (CLI) to configure APM:Copter"
msgstr "使用命令行解释器（CLI）配置 APM:Copter"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:174
#: a7610811770640609cafb9160c6fd2e5
msgid ""
"You don't need to use the Mission Planner to set up APM:Copter (and there "
"are some advanced configuration options not covered by the Mission Planner)."
" You can also use APM's built-in Command Line Interpreter (CLI) over a "
"serial terminal, which will work on any computer and operating system. It is"
" only available via the USB cable; it cannot be used via a Xbee/3DR wireless"
" connection."
msgstr ""
"您无需使用 Mission Planner 来设置 APM:Copter（并且有一些高级配置选项 Mission Planner "
"不涵盖）。您也可以通过串口终端使用 APM 内置的命令行解释器（CLI），该功能在任何计算机和操作系统上均可使用。但它只能通过 USB 线使用，不能通过"
" Xbee/3DR 无线连接使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:181
#: 2e4b11b07cec47978ddbbc186306c64e
msgid ""
"You will also need to use the CLI for such functions as assigning your "
"preferred flight modes to your RC transmitter's toggle switches. See the "
"menu descriptions below for instructions."
msgstr "您还需要使用 CLI 进行某些功能操作，例如将首选飞行模式分配给遥控器的拨动开关。有关说明，请参阅下面的菜单描述。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:185
#: 53a6eab36ed849d7aa1bb4a17db4bf4d
msgid ""
"You can enter the CLI by hitting \"Enter\" three times in the Mission "
"Planner Terminal screen."
msgstr "您可以通过在 Mission Planner 终端界面连续按三次「Enter」进入 CLI。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:188
#: 13189c0f1b424526a18b1b6e0b67c16e
msgid ""
"When you open it, it will look like this (with a more recent version number "
"of the software displayed):"
msgstr "打开后，它将如下所示（显示更新版本号的软件）："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:194
#: c2a8022be4df4e0d8ccb2d2f46925a67
msgid ""
"If you're not using Windows, you can also use the Serial Monitor built into "
"Arduino (remember to select the right baud rate and enable CRs as shown "
"here):"
msgstr "如果您不使用 Windows，也可以使用 Arduino 内置的串口监视器（请记住选择正确的波特率并启用 CR，如图所示）："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:201
#: e01ad73813824843a3621d089eee2b8c
msgid ""
"Once you are in the CLI, you can type \"help\" at any menu and get a full "
"list of available commands."
msgstr "进入 CLI 后，您可以在任何菜单中输入「help」获取可用命令的完整列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:204
#: 8a4c5cb469534b66a0406941f252c801
msgid "There are three top-level menus: Setup, Test and Logs."
msgstr "有三个顶级菜单：Setup、Test 和 Logs。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:209
#: 72d914fc198a4666a160295b0d1ed9ee
msgid ""
"Each has sub-menus, whose command can also be seen by typing \"help\" when "
"you are in that section."
msgstr "每个菜单都有子菜单，在该部分输入「help」也可查看其命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:213
#: c6c4ecea79444d38a34b73f587ff868e
msgid "Setup Menu"
msgstr "Setup 菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:218
#: 699ca3dd24a848c389ee306c490dcd0e
msgid ""
"CLI interactive setup - You must go through each item and set the values to "
"match your hardware"
msgstr "CLI 交互式设置——您必须逐项检查并设置与您硬件匹配的数值"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:222
#: b6416849f2d64e94a4164a2e727d3a89
msgid "\"setup\" menu:commands:"
msgstr "「setup」菜单命令："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:224
#: 4bc943a1eb7141ec9e8bedc2a5fed774
msgid ""
"**erase**: When installing ACM for the first time, run this to erase bad "
"values from EEPROM -- just in case!"
msgstr "**erase**：首次安装 ACM 时，运行此命令清除 EEPROM 中的错误数值——以防万一！"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:226
#: 96788bbf60de400db50e3b2d8ebe11b2
msgid "**reset**: Performs factory reset and initialization of EEPROM values"
msgstr "**reset**：执行工厂重置并初始化 EEPROM 数值"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:227
#: 9903a69920474187a3d45956967fee71
msgid ""
"**radio**: Records the limits of ALL radio channels - very important!!!"
msgstr "**radio**：记录所有遥控通道的限值——非常重要！！！"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:229
#: bc9938d648e74e8f844b36c76cd319de
msgid ""
"**motors**: Interactive setup of your ESC and motors. Enter this mode, then "
"plug-in battery, move your RC transmitter's pitch/roll sticks in each "
"direction to make the prop in that direction spin (so moving the stick up "
"will make the front rotor spin on a quad, and moving it right will make the "
"right rotor spin). For copters with more than four motors, it will spin "
"groups of motors, with the one closest to the direction of the stick going "
"fastest."
msgstr ""
"**motors**：ESC "
"和电机的交互式设置。进入此模式后，接上电池，向各方向移动遥控器的俯仰/横滚摇杆，使该方向的螺旋桨旋转（即向上移动摇杆会使四旋翼前旋翼旋转，向右移动会使右旋翼旋转）。对于超过四个电机的多旋翼，将以组为单位旋转电机，最靠近摇杆方向的电机转速最快。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:236
#: 3be6b81e0292464ca041ba7c3766b36d
msgid "**level**: Sets initial value of accelerometers - hold copter level"
msgstr "**level**：设置加速度计初始值——保持多旋翼水平"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:237
#: 7b85b990d801497aa5e9e673d6e6cd3b
msgid ""
"**modes**: Sets the flight modes assigned to each switch position (you have "
"5 available). Use your aileron/roll stick on your RC transmitter to scroll "
"through the options. Full right moves forward through the list; full left "
"moves back. Hit enter to save your settings and exit this mode."
msgstr ""
"**modes**：设置分配给每个开关位置的飞行模式（共 5 "
"个可用）。使用遥控器的副翼/横滚摇杆滚动选项。完全向右向前翻页，完全向左向后翻页。按回车键保存设置并退出此模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:242
#: 138c029252834c85a5308774e7426c9c
msgid "**frame**: Sets your frame config: (x, +, v (Octo))"
msgstr "**frame**：设置机架配置：(x、+、v（Octo）)"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:243
#: c6715b8f6e494215bbddba58eede2ff2
msgid ""
"**current**: Enables an AttoPilot current sensor: (on, off, milliamp hours)"
msgstr "**current**：启用 AttoPilot 电流传感器：（开启、关闭、毫安时）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:245
#: 1fa9c98dfb75405ab154d10486098880
msgid ""
"**sonar**: Enable sonar sensor. Sensor hooks to the \"pitot\" port which is "
"an analog input (on, off). See installation details :ref:`here "
"<copter:common-rangefinder-landingpage>`."
msgstr ""
"**sonar**：启用声纳传感器。传感器连接到「pitot」端口，该端口为模拟输入（开启、关闭）。安装详情请参见 :ref:`此处 "
"<copter:common-rangefinder-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:248
#: a81a6a4454c848a9a63ea543e3611cca
msgid "**compass**: Enables the compass (on, off)"
msgstr "**compass**：启用罗盘（开启、关闭）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:249
#: 7e649044512247218bb46ec6cc51460b
msgid ""
"**declination**: Sets your local declination value -- lookup online for "
"accuracy (decimal degrees)"
msgstr "**declination**：设置您当地的偏磁角值——在线查询以获取精确数值（十进制度）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:251
#: 1e7f08bc71f1442e9d4a9f3ae23c4293
msgid "**show**: A formatted output of all the settings"
msgstr "**show**：格式化输出所有设置"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:254
#: 0da54c28627f4fa28c6da896c98b8d36
msgid "Test Menu"
msgstr "Test 菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:260
#: a293ff0c452c4ce89586dfb64e9c14e4
msgid "\"test\" menu commands:"
msgstr "「test」菜单命令："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:262
#: 5f800461b17a49e9b1bf1b7b5ee5ba27
msgid "**pwm**: Outputs the pwm values of all 8 radio channels"
msgstr "**pwm**：输出所有 8 个遥控通道的 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:263
#: d95bc71bfa00403b9e70868d19b30a03
msgid ""
"**radio**: Outputs the control values of all 8 radio channels in degrees x "
"100 or other value (see radio.pde)"
msgstr "**radio**：以度 x 100 或其他数值（见 radio.pde）输出所有 8 个遥控通道的控制值"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:265
#: f88e3e9514c94ceaaa75b145b9993cb8
msgid "**failsafe**: (Not currently used)"
msgstr "**failsafe**：（当前未使用）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:266
#: 7aecd6965bf4481aa8cb32822e1e631a
msgid ""
"**stabilize**: Lets you test the stabilization with debugging output to the "
"terminal (may spin the props -- not recommended for flying)."
msgstr "**stabilize**：允许您测试稳定功能，并向终端输出调试信息（可能会转动螺旋桨——不建议飞行时使用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:268
#: bd8a0b2a9b664491b411fc70d06826fa
msgid ""
"**gps**: Outputs GPS data. Note: typically you must be outside to get GPS "
"lock. It can take two minutes or more to achieve lock at first power on."
msgstr "**gps**：输出 GPS 数据。注意：通常需要在户外才能获得 GPS 锁定。首次上电时可能需要两分钟或更长时间才能锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:271
#: 8d483bd04ae6431393a3a09584673972
msgid "**adc**: Outputs raw adc values"
msgstr "**adc**：输出原始 ADC 值"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:272
#: 3e2d3bf04a994ba0b803c9b1cf13f757
msgid "**imu**: Outputs euler angles"
msgstr "**imu**：输出欧拉角"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:273
#: 3271c8ca58b045999d99a80328092027
msgid "**battery**: Outputs voltage readings to analog in 0-3"
msgstr "**battery**：输出模拟输入 0-3 的电压读数"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:274
#: 478cdbbd82ed4cc5966ccad2eb9567b6
msgid "**tune**: (Not currently used)"
msgstr "**tune**：（当前未使用）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:275
#: f7f36823897c47c1b93b32e9c1b1bb7c
msgid ""
"**current**: Outputs voltage and current from an AttoPilot current sensor. "
"Motors will spin, so disconnect your four-wire cable or take off your props!"
msgstr "**current**：输出 AttoPilot 电流传感器的电压和电流。电机将会旋转，请断开四线连接器或取下螺旋桨！"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:278
#: c76384f8fc714b98abe5a218e796afd7
msgid "**relay**: Toggles the relay"
msgstr "**relay**：切换继电器"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:279
#: 6eb0f648481b427e8c096e2454768e54
msgid "**waypoints**: Dumps stored waypoint commands"
msgstr "**waypoints**：转储存储的航点命令"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:280
#: 3fc8d6b388cd47cbae64ffd3c42c6c03
msgid "**altitude**: Displays output from onboard barometric pressure sensor"
msgstr "**altitude**：显示板载气压传感器的输出"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:281
#: 375bd824bc0a45b79c8a5d7b72d69020
msgid "**sonar**: Displays output from sonar sensor (if attached and enabled)"
msgstr "**sonar**：显示声纳传感器的输出（如已连接并启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:283
#: 75027b6df36c4c769ee15b9227c73c48
msgid "**compass**: Outputs compass angles in degrees (0 = north)"
msgstr "**compass**：以度输出罗盘角度（0 = 北）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:284
#: 8a75a8d527244541b19de9d0d23084a8
msgid "**xbee**: Outputs an XBEE sequence used for range testing"
msgstr "**xbee**：输出用于距离测试的 XBEE 序列"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:285
#: bbf66b168c8e478b9a03e8e69b5bca3e
msgid "**eedump**: Raw output of bytes in EEPROM"
msgstr "**eedump**：原始输出 EEPROM 中的字节"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:286
#: 0c7762fdf6f44f1e9b6c1cb5cf07a376
msgid "**rawgps**: Outputs raw, unparsed GPS data"
msgstr "**rawgps**：输出原始未解析的 GPS 数据"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:287
#: 092b8fadfb70465cac8a69a56a3b2174
msgid ""
"**mission**: Writes a default mission to EEPROM (null, 'wp'). Choosing 'wp' "
"option will send the copter 15 meters North and back again."
msgstr "**mission**：向 EEPROM 写入默认任务（null、「wp」）。选择「wp」选项将使多旋翼向北飞行 15 米后返回。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:292
#: 05b67c3501f24ed687b2190294e80aa9
msgid "Logs Menu"
msgstr "Logs 菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:298
#: 5d5efd83ef39426497c77e80ca36aa93
msgid "\"logs\" menu commands:"
msgstr "「logs」菜单命令："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interface.rst:300
#: 2f5397cbb98340bd8a07424df06232d4
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`datalogging page <copter:common-downloading-and-analyzing-"
"data-logs-in-mission-planner>` to better understand how to dump logs and how"
" to set the types of data you want to record."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`数据日志页面 <copter:common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-"
"mission-planner>` 以更好地了解如何转储日志以及如何设置要记录的数据类型。"
